# One line-ending story on every platform.
#
# Compiled raw-string literals (TaskPrompt, the fixture generator's context block) inherit the
# checkout's line endings, so a CRLF working tree quietly changed what the app sent to providers
# and what `dotnet test` regenerated into src/web/design/*.json. An LF working tree makes both
# deterministic; every toolchain here (dotnet, node, Docker) is happy with LF on Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf
